  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Shiraka Training Programme Food Safety 2019</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this annual course is to provide civil servants and relevant semi-public organisations working in the field of food safety to share their knowledge and skills enabling them to lead and inspire the modernisation of Food Safety in their home countries. The course also aims to strengthen participants ties with the Netherlands and stakeholders in the Dutch Food Safety sector.</narrative>
  </description>
